  "solution": "Vì miền nghiệm có chứa cả bờ nên loại phương án <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta thấy\n\t\t<ul><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>≠</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∉</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó loại phương án <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mặt khác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> không thuộc miền nghiệm của bất phương trình nên loại phương án <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>",
